[SIZE="3"]Tired of wasting precious seconds of your life pondering which riding skill to train?

Introducing [B]Aenathel's Lazy Riding Skill Trainer[/B]! Rated the #1 time saver [SIZE="1"][1][/SIZE] by the Tamrielic Stablemaster's Association (TSA), this add-on will save you hours [SIZE="1"][2][/SIZE] over the course of your ESO career [SIZE="1"][3][/SIZE]![/SIZE]

[SIZE="4"][B]Dependencies[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE="3"]The following dependencies are needed for the add-on to work:

[LIST]
[*]LibAddonMenu-2.0
[*]LibChatMessage
[/LIST][/SIZE]
[SIZE="4"][B]Why?[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE="3"]Because I can. And because it's one less thing to think about when playing ESO.[/SIZE]

[SIZE="4"][B]How?[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE="3"]The add-on performs riding skill training for you when you talk to a stablemaster, but you must (unfortunately) still make the trek to the nearest stables yourself.

You can choose between the following skill priorities:

[LIST]
[*]Carry Capacity, Speed, Stamina
[*]Carry Capacity, Stamina, Speed
[*]Speed, Carry Capacity, Stamina
[*]Speed, Stamina, Carry Capacity
[*]Stamina, Carry Capacity, Speed
[*]Stamina, Speed, Carry Capacity
[/LIST][/SIZE]
[SIZE="3"]You can also choose to log out automatically after training to save time on characters that you aren't actively playing to save even more time! [SIZE="1"][3][/SIZE][/SIZE]
[SIZE="1"]
[1] Aenathel's Lazy Riding Skill Trainer is not officially endorsed by the Tamrielic Stablemaster's Association, nor does Tamrielic Stablemaster's Association actually exist.
[2] Based on 5 seconds saved per 180 stablemaster interactions across 18 characters totaling 4.5 hours saved.
[3] Total time saved per logout interaction varies depending on player typing speed and/or mouse dexterity.
[4] Assumes no prior investments in riding skill on any characters. (Terms [SIZE="1"][5][/SIZE] and limitations [SIZE="1"][6][/SIZE] apply.)
[5] You still need to pay 250 gold per upgrade totaling 45,000 gold for all upgrades.
[6] You must still go and talk to the stablemaster yourself.
[/SIZE]
